          "contents": "**Goal:** What is the loop supposed to do?\n\n\n\n**Constraints:** What MUST be true? \n(Hint: what does the loop need to stop on?)\n\n\n\n**Edge cases:** What could go wrong?\n(Hint: what if the loop's stopping condition is never met?)",
